# Feature constants

Put feature-level constants in `src/features/<feature>/constants.ts`, not in component modules.

- Copy maps, lookup tables, and nav/title maps (`Record<View, …>`, `navigation`, weekday labels, icon maps keyed by domain id)
- Shared magic strings and default values for that feature
- Import them with `@/features/<feature>/constants`

Keep in the component: `Intl` formatters, `import.meta.env` flags, CSS module re-exports, and one-off locals that are not feature data.
